  "The complete route exceeds the time budget.": "完整航迹超过航时预算。",
  "No valid complete route satisfies the time budget, coverage and GDOP limits.": "没有完整航迹同时满足航时预算、覆盖和 GDOP 条件。",
  "Joint fit failed the remaining-step check:": "联合解算未通过剩余步长检查：",
  "scaled step": "缩放步长",
  "Unidentifiable nominal design": "名义设计不可辨识",
  "Insufficient observations for joint calibration.": "用于联合标定的观测不足。",
  "Enter 1 to 64 finite ENU beacon coordinate triples.": "请输入 1–64 个有限值的 ENU 信标坐标。",
  "Minimum time budget must be less than maximum time budget.": "最短航时预算必须小于最长预算。",
  "Specify rotation_divisions or angles_deg, not both.": "等分数与显式角度列表只能提供一种。",
  "Scale search exceeds 2000 candidates. Reduce families, angles, seed scales or refinement rounds; no candidates were silently dropped.": "尺度搜索超过 2000 条候选，请减少形状、角度、初始尺度数或细化轮数；程序未静默删减候选。",
  "No candidate meets coverage, identifiability, duration and GDOP requirements. Review the candidate reasons.": "没有候选同时满足覆盖、可辨识性、航时与 GDOP 要求，请查看各候选的具体原因。",
  "User minimum and maximum budgets define ten inclusive logarithmically spaced caps. Each complete candidate is simulated once; all caps select from these same results without truncating routes or rerandomizing observations.": "用户给定最短和最长预算后生成含端点的十档对数等距上限。每条完整候选只仿真一次，各预算复用相同结果，不截断航迹或重新抽取观测噪声。",
  "Closed survey curves are traversed once, with no centre departure/return legs or repeated laps. Isolated crossings are allowed. Transit from an unspecified port is excluded.": "闭合航迹只遍历一次，无中心往返段或重复绕行；允许孤立交点，不计未指定港口的进出场航程。",
  "User scale bounds are strict. Search adds in-range budget-boundary scales and log-midpoints near both C1 and C3 winners. It is a finite refined search, not a global continuous optimum. Circle angle controls starting phase; other family angles control orientation.": "严格遵守用户尺度上下界，补充预算边界尺度并在 C1、C3 优势候选附近添加对数中点。这是有限候选细化搜索，不保证连续全局最优；圆形角度控制起始相位，其他类型控制旋转方向。",
  "Serial polling addresses one beacon per slot. Slots use the larger of the requested interval and conservative two-way acoustic occupancy.": "每个时隙依次询问一个信标，间隔取请求采样间隔和保守双程声学占用时间中的较大值。",
  "Layered Snell rays with perturbations integrated along the reference ray: exp(-depth/1000 m), shared OU amplitude and fixed horizontal gradients.": "使用分层 Snell 声线，沿参考声线积分扰动：exp(-深度/1000 m)、共享 OU 幅度及固定水平梯度。",
  "Jointly estimates all beacon coordinates, common sound-speed offset, delay, linear drift and relative beacon delays. No coordinate truth priors.": "联合估计所有信标坐标、公共声速偏差、时延、线性漂移及信标相对时延，不施加坐标真值先验。",
  "C1/C3 are declared local risks with C3 radius 1. Position errors are from one simulation realisation, not repeated-trial MSE.": "C1/C3 是声明模型下的局部风险，C3 椭球半径取 1；坐标误差来自单次仿真实现，不是重复试验均方误差。",
  "Nuisance prior SDs: sound offset 2 m/s, common/relative delays 5 ms, drift 1 ms/hour. Effective timing noise has a 0.1 microsecond numerical floor. C1 includes prior uncertainty.": "干扰参数先验标准差：声速偏差 2 m/s，公共与相对时延 5 ms，漂移 1 ms/h；有效走时噪声的数值下限为 0.1 微秒。C1 包含先验不确定性。",
  "Range is an assumed slant-range cutoff, without a device link budget, separate transmit/receive positions or full 3D acoustics. Scoring approximates GNSS errors as independent time noise.": "距离为假设的斜距截止条件，未包含设备链路预算、分离收发位置或完整三维声学；评分将 GNSS 误差近似为独立走时噪声。",
  "coordinate": "坐标",
  "`ftol` termination condition is satisfied.": "达到目标函数变化容差。",
  "Uploaded SSP": "上传声速剖面",
  "Uploaded profile values are used without smoothing or decimation.": "直接使用上传剖面，不进行平滑或抽稀。",
  "Set the usable slant range for your equipment. Only observations to the out-of-range beacon are excluded.": "按设备设置有效斜距；超距时只剔除对应信标的观测。",
  "One circle, two perpendicular diameters and a straight transfer. Transfer time is included; sampling there is off by default.": "完整圆周和两条正交直径，以直线连接两条直径，连接段计入航时，默认不采集数据。",
  "Complete routes include their transfer travel. Dashed segments are transfers, with sampling off by default. Beacons respond in sequence; propagation time limits the sampling interval.": "完整航迹计入连接段航程。虚线为连接段，默认不采集数据。信标依次应答，传播时间限制采样间隔。",
  "Sample straight transfer": "连接段采集数据",
  "Off by default. Transfer travel always counts in sailing time.": "默认关闭；连接段始终计入总航时。",
  "Transfer segment": "连接段",
