  "Seeds and budget boundaries only": "不细化：仅初始及预算边界尺度",
  "Refinement tests extra sizes near promising C1/C3 candidates for each shape and angle within the time caps. On the logarithmic grid, 4 and 9 km give a new 6 km size. One round adds once; two rounds repeat. Bounds and complete-route rules stay fixed; more rounds take longer.": "在每种形状和方向的较好 C1/C3 候选附近补充中间尺寸，再按航时上限比较。例如对数尺度中，4 km 和 9 km 之间补充 6 km。一轮补一次，两轮再补一次；不改变尺度上下限和完整航迹规则，轮数越多计算越久。",
